was not feeling good at all.

01:05:00.600 --> 01:05:04.220
They tried to give the creature some fruit and water.

01:05:04.220 --> 01:05:05.600
It didn't accept.

01:05:05.600 --> 01:05:10.600
And the reason why they filmed this creature

01:05:10.600 --> 01:05:13.300
without superior authorization,

01:05:13.300 --> 01:05:15.860
it's because they were pretty mad

01:05:15.860 --> 01:05:19.020
that the American militaries were coming to Brazil

01:05:19.020 --> 01:05:20.780
to take all these material, not, you know,

01:05:20.780 --> 01:05:23.680
not only the pictures, the footage,

01:05:23.680 --> 01:05:27.980
but the creatures itself and the spacecraft

01:05:27.980 --> 01:05:29.880
as they took it to the United States.

01:05:29.880 --> 01:05:34.310
So some other militaries friend of mine

01:05:34.310 --> 01:05:37.890
had the chance without authorization

01:05:37.890 --> 01:05:39.850
to make this movie.

01:05:39.850 --> 01:05:44.110
And right now I'm willing to put my right hand tomorrow

01:05:44.110 --> 01:05:48.870
on a Bible and take a live public lie detector test

01:05:48.870 --> 01:05:51.190
that everything I'm telling you is true.

01:05:51.190 --> 01:05:52.450
The truth.

01:05:52.450 --> 01:05:53.290
Yeah.

01:05:53.290 --> 01:05:55.070
Now he grew up in Tres Corazones,

01:05:55.070 --> 01:05:57.790
which is like the region, Minas Gerais,

01:05:57.790 --> 01:05:59.930
where the ESA military base is.

01:05:59.930 --> 01:06:02.190
So he knew all those people that worked at the base.

01:06:02.190 --> 01:06:04.470
They knew him, he grew up there.

01:06:04.470 --> 01:06:07.070
So like after all the investigations,

01:06:07.070 --> 01:06:08.970
his life's threatened and all the stuff that went down,

01:06:08.970 --> 01:06:09.810
he said he disappeared.

01:06:09.810 --> 01:06:11.130
I think he went to go live with his mother

01:06:11.130 --> 01:06:13.170
or something somewhere for 20 years.

01:06:13.170 --> 01:06:14.910
And then when Moment of Contact,

01:06:14.910 --> 01:06:16.910
the first version came out in 2022,

01:06:16.910 --> 01:06:18.610
that's when Peccacini came back on the radar

01:06:18.610 --> 01:06:20.010
and it was like, hey, you know what?

01:06:20.010 --> 01:06:21.370
I'm ready to get back in the ring.

01:06:21.370 --> 01:06:22.210
Yeah.

01:06:22.210 --> 01:06:23.670
And finish this fight.

01:06:23.670 --> 01:06:24.590
And so, yeah.

01:06:24.590 --> 01:06:27.370
So you have multiple people in the hospital system.

01:06:27.370 --> 01:06:30.390
You've now gotten military whistleblowers.

01:06:30.390 --> 01:06:32.530
You have civilian witnesses.

01:06:32.530 --> 01:06:33.890
I have the guy that drove it.

01:06:33.890 --> 01:06:36.150
You have the guy that drove the being.

01:06:36.150 --> 01:06:37.570
Yeah, that saw it and drove it.

01:06:37.570 --> 01:06:42.350
To say like the amount of disparate uncorrelated sources,

01:06:42.350 --> 01:06:43.670
I think is just-

01:06:43.670 --> 01:06:44.490
Unbelievable.

01:06:44.490 --> 01:06:47.570
And that comes from you literally touching down in Virginia

01:06:47.570 --> 01:06:49.270
and on a piece of paper,

01:06:49.270 --> 01:06:51.350
like do you know what happened in 1996?

01:06:51.370 --> 01:06:53.210
What does he think about the case?

01:06:53.210 --> 01:06:54.870
Does he think it happened or it didn't happen?

01:06:54.870 --> 01:06:55.710
Absolutely.

01:06:55.710 --> 01:06:57.910
What are your feelings on Virginia?

01:07:06.410 --> 01:07:08.590
You have two types of people in this movie,

01:07:08.590 --> 01:07:12.010
people who are extremely afraid and admitting what they saw.

01:07:12.010 --> 01:07:14.130
And all of those stories line up.

01:07:14.130 --> 01:07:15.770
Everything lines up perfectly.

01:07:15.770 --> 01:07:16.610
It all lines up perfectly.

01:07:16.610 --> 01:07:18.670
You have a flight path of the UFO.

01:07:18.670 --> 01:07:21.370
You have all these witnesses and these disparate, you know,

01:07:21.370 --> 01:07:23.330
places who aren't coordinating clearly.

01:07:23.330 --> 01:07:25.690
And then, so that's one type of person.

01:07:25.690 --> 01:07:27.330
And then you have the other type of people

01:07:27.330 --> 01:07:29.350
that are like lying through their teeth.

01:07:29.350 --> 01:07:31.730
And so, like the commander at-

01:07:31.730 --> 01:07:34.590
Yes, Lima, General Lima.

01:07:34.590 --> 01:07:35.430
General Lima.

01:07:35.430 --> 01:07:37.610
Yeah, we're in touch with him now, by the way.

01:07:37.610 --> 01:07:38.450
Oh, amazing.

01:07:38.450 --> 01:07:41.430
You got to talk to him because even if he lies to you,

01:07:41.430 --> 01:07:45.910
you know, it's like, you see the smugness when he goes,

01:07:45.910 --> 01:07:47.650
you know, we were serving our country that day.

01:07:47.650 --> 01:07:48.490
Yeah, national security.

01:07:48.490 --> 01:07:50.710
Can we get some, yeah, can we get some details on like,

01:07:50.710 --> 01:07:53.230
how you served the country that day, what you did?

01:07:53.230 --> 01:07:54.930
He said, no, absolutely not.

01:07:54.930 --> 01:07:59.370
And, but he says it in such a, like a condescending, cynical,

01:07:59.370 --> 01:08:01.690
like, I don't care what you think sort of way,

01:08:01.690 --> 01:08:02.950
and then walks away.

01:08:28.360 --> 01:08:30.360
There was another part to this,

01:08:30.360 --> 01:08:32.180
when interviews were conducted,

01:08:32.180 --> 01:08:34.460
and that's when Euclides and Calado,

01:08:34.460 --> 01:08:37.060
the two young men from here, traveled all the way

01:08:37.060 --> 01:08:42.730
to the sergeant's school of arms in Tres Corazones.

01:08:42.730 --> 01:08:45.450
Then they managed to ask a question.

01:08:45.450 --> 01:08:47.830
Then the sergeant went inside, came back and said,

01:08:47.830 --> 01:08:51.750
no, but aren't you going to say anything about the case?

01:08:51.750 --> 01:08:54.570
Look, if you ask one more question, you'll be arrested.

01:08:54.570 --> 01:08:59.270
We were investigating the case at the ESA headquarters.

01:08:59.270 --> 01:08:59.810
The sergeant-

01:08:59.810 --> 01:09:04.310
The sergeant's school of arms, and I had never been arrested

01:09:04.310 --> 01:09:11.270
for doing my job, neither before nor after this case.

01:09:11.270 --> 01:09:14.190
I was just having a normal, regular day at the barracks,

01:09:14.190 --> 01:09:14.690
you know?

01:09:14.690 --> 01:09:17.210
Then around 9 o'clock in the morning,

01:09:17.210 --> 01:09:21.170
we received orders, a mission, to get some vehicles ready,

01:09:21.170 --> 01:09:23.270
you know, some trucks, specifically

01:09:23.270 --> 01:09:24.830
for an important operation.

01:09:24.830 --> 01:09:27.590
And that we, our unit, would be deploying,

01:09:27.590 --> 01:09:29.750
we would be moving out, heading directly

01:09:29.750 --> 01:09:29.790
to the barracks.

01:09:29.790 --> 01:09:36.790
We were given the order that we should proceed

01:09:36.790 --> 01:09:39.130
to follow a number of specific vehicles,

01:09:39.130 --> 01:09:42.590
which were clearly unmarked, and definitely not military.

01:09:43.070 --> 01:09:46.690
So I followed this military man, you know,

01:09:46.790 --> 01:09:48.570
who was from the Secret Service,

01:09:49.030 --> 01:09:52.990
passing through the city center near the hospital,

01:09:53.310 --> 01:09:55.470
if I'm not mistaken, the regional hospital.

01:09:55.950 --> 01:09:58.730
And afterwards, we went to Humanitas Hospital.

01:10:01.510 --> 01:10:02.870
When the instruction was given to us,

01:10:02.870 --> 01:10:10.960
to back a vehicle up into Humanitas Hospital.

01:10:10.960 --> 01:10:13.600
When I was approaching the entrance,

01:10:13.600 --> 01:10:15.800
how exactly can I express it?

01:10:15.800 --> 01:10:18.800
Of the hospital's immediate surroundings,

01:10:18.800 --> 01:10:23.080
I noticed a container, a stainless steel table

01:10:23.080 --> 01:10:26.540
with a container on it, you know, with several doctors

01:10:26.540 --> 01:10:29.800
and other staff members holding clipboards.

01:10:31.960 --> 01:10:37.160
As I was analyzing, it seemed that everyone else was also caught up

01:10:37.160 --> 01:10:38.960
in the same thing.

01:10:39.220 --> 01:10:42.840
And when I realized, I saw something completely different.

01:10:43.960 --> 01:10:48.080
You know, a different kind of creature with skin

01:10:48.080 --> 01:10:52.360
that was very oily, very, I'd describe it as having a sort

01:10:52.360 --> 01:10:56.520
of silicone-like texture, and that sight really startled me.

01:10:57.060 --> 01:10:59.200
But what truly caught my attention,

01:10:59.200 --> 01:11:02.380
what later convinced me that it wasn't a human being

01:11:02.380 --> 01:11:04.140
at all, was its foot.

01:11:08.300 --> 01:11:10.500
Everyone was completely taken aback by the news.

01:11:10.720 --> 01:11:13.380
They were all incredibly, incredibly surprised.

01:11:13.380 --> 01:11:16.190
We have, for the first time ever as well,

01:11:16.190 --> 01:11:18.390
we have the police officer, which had been trying

01:11:18.390 --> 01:11:19.590
to get to him for so long.

01:11:19.590 --> 01:11:23.010
Marco Leal was going by his house, knocking on his door.

01:11:23.010 --> 01:11:27.040
He would set up arrangements for us to meet with him.

01:11:27.040 --> 01:11:29.540
And it was always, it was like slipping between your feet.

01:11:29.540 --> 01:11:31.740
It's like trying to grab a bar of soap in the bathtub.

01:11:31.740 --> 01:11:33.860
You know, it's like, pooh, pooh, like you got your hand on it,

01:11:33.860 --> 01:11:35.320
but then it's like gone, you know?

01:11:35.320 --> 01:11:40.320
And that was the former chief of police, Aguilar, Pedro Aguilar.

01:11:40.320 --> 01:11:44.920
And he had, allegedly, according to people

01:11:44.920 --> 01:11:46.540
that we tracked him down, he had a photograph

01:11:46.540 --> 01:11:48.200
of one of the things.

01:11:48.200 --> 01:11:51.700
But anyway, he described the activity at the base.

01:11:51.700 --> 01:11:54.580
He was at the base as chief of police.

01:11:54.580 --> 01:11:56.720
He was invited in there, and he said that,

01:11:56.720 --> 01:11:58.400
he described it just like everybody else.

01:11:58.400 --> 01:12:01.160
Every single bit of testimony from separate people

01:12:01.160 --> 01:12:04.740
from all over the area, all fits perfectly.

01:12:04.740 --> 01:12:06.760
It's like putting together a piece of puzzle, right?

01:12:06.760 --> 01:12:09.480
Not once have we had it any other way.

01:12:09.480 --> 01:12:10.600
Yeah.

01:12:10.600 --> 01:12:12.160
You know, we're putting these pieces together.

01:12:12.160 --> 01:12:15.180
So now the piece we're missing is on the American side,

01:12:15.180 --> 01:12:18.160
and we want to get with Humanitas Hospital.

01:12:18.160 --> 01:12:19.420
So it's like ongoing.

01:12:19.420 --> 01:12:20.260
Yeah.

01:12:20.260 --> 01:12:23.060
Well, the chief of police says this is not a story,

01:12:23.060 --> 01:12:23.900
it's history.

01:12:23.900 --> 01:12:24.740
Yes.

01:12:24.740 --> 01:12:25.580
And, you know, he-

01:12:25.580 --> 01:12:26.500
You remember well.

01:12:26.500 --> 01:12:27.760
Oh yeah, it's a great movie.

01:12:27.760 --> 01:12:30.680
And it's, he just, he said, you know, this happened.

01:12:30.680 --> 01:12:31.620
I participated.

01:12:31.620 --> 01:12:34.500
He said, I participated, absolutely.

01:12:34.500 --> 01:12:37.980
And are you at all conspiratorial about the fact

01:12:37.980 --> 01:12:40.160
that he just died and that you were,

01:12:40.160 --> 01:12:42.920
about to go in a couple of weeks to go see him?

01:12:42.920 --> 01:12:43.980
Yeah, again, I know.

01:12:43.980 --> 01:12:47.200
And allegedly he has a photo of the ET beam.

01:12:47.200 --> 01:12:48.040
Yeah.

01:12:48.040 --> 01:12:50.680
Do you think that that timing is coincidental?

01:12:50.680 --> 01:12:52.600
I mean, anything's possible.

01:12:52.600 --> 01:12:54.160
It's very unfortunate.

01:12:54.160 --> 01:12:55.040
Was he in good health?

01:12:55.040 --> 01:12:55.880
Do you know?

01:12:55.880 --> 01:12:57.680
I mean, he's, you see him on camera.

01:12:57.680 --> 01:12:59.760
Yeah, and that was, you filmed that, what?

01:12:59.760 --> 01:13:01.940
You filmed that like not too long ago, right?

01:13:01.940 --> 01:13:03.920
We knocked, so it was really crazy, actually.

01:13:03.920 --> 01:13:05.180
It was just a couple of months ago.

01:13:05.180 --> 01:13:09.220
And we were gonna doorstep him on the way to Varginho.

01:13:09.220 --> 01:13:10.040
And I say doorstep.

01:13:10.040 --> 01:13:11.420
He didn't just show up at the door, right?

01:13:11.420 --> 01:13:12.260
Yeah.

01:13:12.260 --> 01:13:15.280
And for some reason I was like,

01:13:15.280 --> 01:13:17.340
I wanna stop and get a slice of pizza.

01:13:17.340 --> 01:13:18.480
And everyone's like, we gotta keep moving.

01:13:18.480 --> 01:13:21.520
It was like five o'clock or 4.30 or something.

01:13:21.520 --> 01:13:22.520
I really was really hungry

01:13:22.520 --> 01:13:23.980
and I wanted to get a slice of pizza.

01:13:23.980 --> 01:13:24.820
So we stopped.

01:13:24.820 --> 01:13:26.100
Reluctantly, half the crew was like,

01:13:26.100 --> 01:13:28.180
oh, we gotta keep moving, blah, blah, blah.

01:13:28.180 --> 01:13:29.540
Well, as it turns out, it was perfect

01:13:29.540 --> 01:13:32.440
because we, the owner of the pizza joint,

01:13:32.440 --> 01:13:36.680
you know, gave us pizza, gave us like really good,

01:13:36.680 --> 01:13:37.900
you know, we took like an hour

01:13:37.900 --> 01:13:40.480
and we just spent a really fun time having pizza

01:13:40.480 --> 01:13:41.840
with the owner of this pizza joint

01:13:41.840 --> 01:13:43.700
and near the area where we're going.

01:13:43.700 --> 01:13:47.920
But it set us back at least 60 minutes, possibly 90 minutes.

01:13:47.920 --> 01:13:49.160
But you know, it was a little later.

01:13:49.160 --> 01:13:51.300
Maybe it was like 7, 7.30 at that point.

01:13:51.300 --> 01:13:52.340
And we show up at his house

01:13:52.340 --> 01:13:54.760
and they had just gotten home like 10 minutes earlier.

01:13:54.760 --> 01:13:56.080
So we would have missed him

01:13:56.080 --> 01:13:59.200
had we not gone and stopped to get that pizza.

01:13:59.200 --> 01:14:02.560
And what we did was is we, you know,

01:14:02.560 --> 01:14:04.540
we started talking to him at the door.

01:14:04.540 --> 01:14:07.800
Then we went inside and we had some, we had audio.

01:14:07.800 --> 01:14:10.480
One of us had audio rolling and the guy in the car outside

01:14:10.480 --> 01:14:13.040
had, you know, our sound guy had, you know,

01:14:13.040 --> 01:14:15.460
it was remote transmitted back to a receiver.

01:14:15.460 --> 01:14:17.960
That was just, you know, the audio.

01:14:17.960 --> 01:14:22.200
And then we're talking, getting to know his wife, his son.

01:14:22.200 --> 01:14:26.160
And then I said, would you mind if we bring a camera in here

01:14:26.160 --> 01:14:28.620
just to kind of, you know, document the moment a little bit,

01:14:28.620 --> 01:14:30.160
just ease our way into it?

01:14:30.160 --> 01:14:31.500
No, that's okay.

01:14:31.500 --> 01:14:35.600
So in comes the camera, we're all sitting down talking

01:14:35.600 --> 01:14:37.640
and his wife, I'll never forget this.

01:14:37.640 --> 01:14:38.940
And I think I have a cut of it somewhere,

01:14:38.940 --> 01:14:40.600
but his wife had these like,

01:14:40.600 --> 01:14:44.100
her eyes were so big and like, kind of just like,

01:14:44.100 --> 01:14:45.840
and her wife was looking at her husband,

01:14:45.840 --> 01:14:48.420
like just wouldn't blink.

01:14:48.420 --> 01:14:50.140
And I'm looking over at my cameraman, Dave,

01:14:50.140 --> 01:14:52.240
and I'm like, are you getting, you know,

01:14:52.240 --> 01:14:53.520
she's just looking at him.

01:14:53.520 --> 01:14:56.060
Like, I'm thinking, does she have the photograph?

01:14:56.060 --> 01:14:58.780
Like, does she, you know, I don't know.

01:14:58.780 --> 01:15:01.300
Is she worried that we're in there probing?

01:15:01.300 --> 01:15:04.930
And at one point we asked him like,

01:15:04.930 --> 01:15:07.050
when things got more comfortable and he goes,

01:15:07.050 --> 01:15:09.050
I'm a, I participate, I'm a witness.

01:15:09.050 --> 01:15:10.650
He saw the creature under a tarp,

01:15:10.650 --> 01:15:12.430
maybe the bottom half or something.

01:15:12.430 --> 01:15:14.390
And then he went into, as a military base,

01:15:14.390 --> 01:15:16.550
he did the activity, helicopters coming and landing.

01:15:16.550 --> 01:15:19.530
He goes, more brass than I'd ever seen ever before.

01:15:19.530 --> 01:15:21.910
Like there were higher ups from all different corners

01:15:21.910 --> 01:15:23.230
of Brazil all there.

01:15:23.230 --> 01:15:25.370
Maybe even blind at some point.

01:15:25.370 --> 01:15:28.150
No, he did say the Americans came, they came to Campinas.

01:15:28.150 --> 01:15:30.910
He said that too, yeah, and took the goodies.

01:15:30.910 --> 01:15:35.300
But he seemed to be in relatively good health.

01:15:35.300 --> 01:15:37.380
I mean, you know, it didn't look like he was gonna win

01:15:37.380 --> 01:15:40.020
like a triathlon or anything, but he was in,

01:15:40.020 --> 01:15:40.780
I mean, he's in the movie.

01:15:40.780 --> 01:15:41.620
Yep.

01:15:41.620 --> 01:15:45.390
And he just died.

01:15:45.390 --> 01:15:50.010
Yeah, and he might've had a photo or footage.

01:15:50.010 --> 01:15:51.770
Well, we talked to two witnesses.

01:15:51.770 --> 01:15:54.730
One of the primary reasons that led us to him

01:15:54.730 --> 01:15:56.610
were two people that described,

01:15:56.610 --> 01:15:58.370
he pulled the photograph out and showed it,

01:15:58.370 --> 01:16:02.790
and it had one alive, one deceased creature,

01:16:02.790 --> 01:16:07.330
and it had military police and fire department

01:16:07.330 --> 01:16:10.650
in the picture with their faces that, you know,

01:16:10.650 --> 01:16:11.490
that's,

01:16:11.490 --> 01:16:13.490
that's the range of the witnesses that we talked to.

01:16:13.490 --> 01:16:15.410
And when I pressed him on it and I don't wanna push too hard,

01:16:15.410 --> 01:16:16.630
but I definitely pressed him on it.

01:16:16.630 --> 01:16:18.210
I've got the footage.

01:16:18.210 --> 01:16:22.200
He said, I was like, well, when I talked to you

01:16:22.200 --> 01:16:25.080
a couple of years ago on a video Zoom call,

01:16:25.080 --> 01:16:27.960
you confessed that you had the photograph

01:16:27.960 --> 01:16:30.120
or that at one point you had the photograph.

01:16:30.120 --> 01:16:32.040
And now you're saying you don't have the photograph.

01:16:32.040 --> 01:16:35.240
Like what's, you know, and I really pressed him on it.

01:16:35.240 --> 01:16:36.080
What did he say?

01:16:36.080 --> 01:16:37.440
He said, well, there's certain things

01:16:37.440 --> 01:16:39.760
within the police department that have to go on set

01:16:39.760 --> 01:16:40.880
or something like that.

01:16:40.880 --> 01:16:44.920
Oh, come on, dude, just let it out.

01:16:44.920 --> 01:16:49.920
You know, and I feel the frustration from people out there

01:16:49.940 --> 01:16:52.380
like, oh, there's not a picture, there's not a video.

01:16:52.380 --> 01:16:55.340
First of all, I never give up and I'm not giving up.

01:16:55.340 --> 01:16:56.200
I will never give up.

01:16:56.200 --> 01:16:57.040
I'm getting closer.

01:16:57.040 --> 01:17:00.320
We are as a team are getting closer and closer and closer.

01:17:00.320 --> 01:17:03.400
And the developments that are happening are unprecedented.

01:17:03.400 --> 01:17:05.040
It's an ongoing investigation.

01:17:05.040 --> 01:17:05.940
I'm not giving up.

01:17:05.940 --> 01:17:07.600
I think this is the case

01:17:07.600 --> 01:17:09.200
that's gonna blow it all out in the open.

01:17:09.200 --> 01:17:10.240
That's my humble opinion,

01:17:10.240 --> 01:17:12.820
